{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_title", "source_sha256": "b59fbcfc4402cbfdea068511879b5194e6bac48f5482a561e64b8fcdd7ec901e", "ja": "奈緒とおでかけ1", "zh": "和奈绪出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6171f24d771b1a9703cc5aa34a4504bd3105e26dda95feb3e82da2ea57e0a582", "ja": "奈緒とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与奈绪出门外出的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c74bcffdcfb159a9dc6d832f2cc5eeeb27ee80f33a6ed5c57fcb8aed3015480", "ja": "（弘前城お膝元での物産展に、奈緒がゲストで参加！\n……のはずが、体当たりの営業トークが冴え渡り……）", "zh": "（奈绪作为嘉宾参加了弘前城脚下的特产展！\n……本来应该是这样，可她那股拼尽全力的推销劲儿实在太厉害了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "a193d21da30b8b801bad2050392d1642bd7afe1c9aca822274339f3fdb87218e", "ja": "アカーン！　{$P$}さん、\nもうこれ以上、一歩も動かれへん！　くたくたです！", "zh": "不行啦！{$P$}先生，我一步都走不动了！累得筋疲力尽啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1498728667c8cd6184ff25b3b0d23f7bb694595534f431f021e2de0b3198c39a", "ja": "商品を全て完売させるなんて……信じられないな！\n地元の人も大喜びだぞ、奈緒！", "zh": "竟然把商品全部卖光了……真让人难以置信！\n当地的人也特别高兴呢，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "1f7ab846cbb03a1152443de7934158048b0c16d90bacd0eb4d45d6627d359802", "ja": "ホンマですか？　よかった～……関西っ子として、\n商売が下手なんて言われるわけにはいきませんから。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了～……作为关西人，可不能被说成不擅长做生意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9b5023dd0939c7d9da3028ba4c291acdc7ca8e81fe1a178ef012fa74c4a127a9", "ja": "そうか……頼もしかったよ。というわけで、\n早速奈緒に、次の依頼が来てるんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊……你可真是帮大忙了。所以说，奈绪马上又接到下一个委托了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "dfae54cd120cb1876bb39d8df698f23c17ac287cd7f581dade9016f19f212613", "ja": "え……？\nまた、ずいぶん気が早いですね……。", "zh": "诶……？\n这也太心急了吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7b69e951c3f14950fc05f2f88ff371c17a0ac48f917506b01bd01386e05513de", "ja": "弘前だけに留まらず、ゆくゆくは青森全域を\n任せてみたいと、物産展の会長さんが……。", "zh": "物产展的会长说，不光是弘前，\n将来甚至想把整个青森都托付给她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "93793d773d337e639db815745ee675abcf81333e8c0615a3b4f7ff813cfb8797", "ja": "いやいや、ちょっと待ってください！\nスケール大きすぎとちゃいます？", "zh": "不不不，先等一下！\n这规模也太大了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "09eead9420e9467b156089c548703094d6d277e47072f7a2ad557a6c52aa97d7", "ja": "いや、でも本当にそんな勢いだったよ。\n今日のところは、帰ってゆっくり休もうな。", "zh": "不是，不过真的就是那种气势。\n今天就先回去好好休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "b1da3d95668bece8c03209fb654e4d2a8530844c36e9d9939ebeb9a618a66c50", "ja": "は～い。ホッとしたら、なんや\nメッチャお腹空いてきましたわ……。", "zh": "好～的。放松下来后，突然觉得肚子好饿啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_037nao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_037nao01_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "1790e82104479a94852b5487dbd5e6bbb8e08e927991b09a7a067b7f344e8049", "ja": "青森のおいしいもん、食べて帰りましょ！\nもちろん、{$P$}さんの奢りな♪", "zh": "青森的美食，吃完再回去吧！\n当然是{$P$}先生请客啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
